[{"id":"basata-17-30-2","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"daje obilno","en":"He extends"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"},{"bs":"i šire","en":"and they spread"},{"bs":"raširio je","en":"he/it spread"}],"ref":"17:30","answerWord":"يَبْسُطُ","answerSound":"audio/fb468d6f394aad28592b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! thy Lord enlargeth the provision for whom He will, and straiteneth (it for whom He will). Lo, He was ever Knower, Seer of His slaves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","يَبْسُطُ","ٱلرِّزْقَ","لِمَن","يَشَآءُ","وَيَقْدِرُ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","بِعِبَادِهِۦ","خَبِيرًۢا","بَصِيرًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-2-245-13","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"i širi","en":"and he/it spreads"},{"bs":"raširio je","en":"he/it spread"},{"bs":"i šire","en":"and they spread"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"}],"ref":"2:245","answerWord":"وَيَبْصُۜطُ","answerSound":"audio/8aaa9386fcf8c940eba1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who is it that will lend unto Allah a goodly loan, so that He may give it increase manifold? Allah straiteneth and enlargeth. Unto Him ye will return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["مَّن","ذَا","ٱلَّذِى","يُقْرِضُ","ٱللَّهَ","قَرْضًا","حَسَنًا","فَيُضَٰعِفَهُۥ","لَهُۥٓ","أَضْعَافًا","كَثِيرَةً","وَٱللَّهُ","يَقْبِضُ","وَيَبْصُۜطُ","وَإِلَيْهِ","تُرْجَعُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-5-11-11","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"šire","en":"they spread"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"},{"bs":"daje obilno","en":"He extends"},{"bs":"raširio si","en":"you spread"}],"ref":"5:11","answerWord":"يَبْسُطُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/28b51671d26b0b6e4e9f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Remember Allah's favour unto you, how a people were minded to stretch out their hands against you but He withheld their hands from you; and keep your duty to Allah. In Allah let believers put their trust.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱذْكُرُوا۟","نِعْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَيْكُمْ","إِذْ","هَمَّ","قَوْمٌ","أَن","يَبْسُطُوٓا۟","إِلَيْكُمْ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","فَكَفَّ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","عَنكُمْ","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَعَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-5-28-1","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"raširio si","en":"you spread"},{"bs":"i širi","en":"and he/it spreads"},{"bs":"i šire","en":"and they spread"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"}],"ref":"5:28","answerWord":"بَسَطتَ","answerSound":"audio/ccf534334c33c6e0d690.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Even if thou stretch out thy hand against me to kill me, I shall not stretch out my hand against thee to kill thee, lo! I fear Allah, the Lord of the Worlds.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["لَئِنۢ","بَسَطتَ","إِلَىَّ","يَدَكَ","لِتَقْتُلَنِى","مَآ","أَنَا۠","بِبَاسِطٍ","يَدِىَ","إِلَيْكَ","لِأَقْتُلَكَ","إِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","ٱللَّهَ","رَبَّ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-30-48-6","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"},{"bs":"raširio si","en":"you spread"},{"bs":"raširio je","en":"he/it spread"},{"bs":"šire","en":"they spread"}],"ref":"30:48","answerWord":"فَيَبْسُطُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/dd008cd7100d6384efd0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah is He Who sendeth the winds so that they raise clouds, and spreadeth them along the sky as pleaseth Him, and causeth them to break and thou seest the rain downpouring from within them. And when He maketh it to fall on whom He will of His bondmen, lo! they rejoice;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِى","يُرْسِلُ","ٱلرِّيَٰحَ","فَتُثِيرُ","سَحَابًا","فَيَبْسُطُهُۥ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","كَيْفَ","يَشَآءُ","وَيَجْعَلُهُۥ","كِسَفًا","فَتَرَى","ٱلْوَدْقَ","يَخْرُجُ","مِنْ","خِلَٰلِهِۦ","فَإِذَآ","أَصَابَ","بِهِۦ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦٓ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-42-27-1","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"raširio je","en":"he/it spread"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"},{"bs":"šire","en":"they spread"},{"bs":"i širi","en":"and he/it spreads"}],"ref":"42:27","answerWord":"بَسَطَ","answerSound":"audio/113ebcc1f433ac22fc30.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if Allah were to enlarge the provision for His slaves they would surely rebel in the earth, but He sendeth down by measure as He willeth. Lo! He is Informed, a Seer of His bondmen.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","بَسَطَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلرِّزْقَ","لِعِبَادِهِۦ","لَبَغَوْا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَٰكِن","يُنَزِّلُ","بِقَدَرٍ","مَّا","يَشَآءُ","إِنَّهُۥ","بِعِبَادِهِۦ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بَصِيرٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"basata-60-2-5","words":["verb:basata"],"options":[{"bs":"i šire","en":"and they spread"},{"bs":"raširio si","en":"you spread"},{"bs":"pa ih širi","en":"so he/it spreads them"},{"bs":"i širi","en":"and he/it spreads"}],"ref":"60:2","answerWord":"وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/2a1b11b4dd8a00c87769.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If they have the upper hand of you, they will be your foes, and will stretch out their hands and their tongues toward you with evil (intent), and they long for you to disbelieve.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"raširiti, pružiti","en":"to spread, to stretch out"},"passage":["إِن","يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","يَكُونُوا۟","لَكُمْ","أَعْدَآءً","وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","إِلَيْكُمْ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم","بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","وَوَدُّوا۟","لَوْ","تَكْفُرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"بَسَطَ"}},{"id":"hafiza-12-65-17","words":["verb:hafiza"],"options":[{"bs":"i čuvamo","en":"and we guard"},{"bs":"i čuvajte!","en":"and (you all) guard!"},{"bs":"i čuvali smo ga","en":"and We guarded it"},{"bs":"i čuvaju","en":"and they guard"}],"ref":"12:65","answerWord":"وَنَحْفَظُ","answerSound":"audio/a734b6149253bed07325.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they opened their belongings they discovered that their merchandise had been returned to them. They said: O our father! What (more) can we ask? Here is our merchandise returned to us. We shall get provision for our folk and guard our brother, and we shall have the extra measure of a camel (load). This (that we bring now) is a light measure.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čuvati, sačuvati, naučiti napamet","en":"to guard, to keep, to memorize"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","فَتَحُوا۟","مَتَٰعَهُمْ","وَجَدُوا۟","بِضَٰعَتَهُمْ","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قَالُوا۟","يَٰٓأَبَانَا","مَا","نَبْغِى","هَٰذِهِۦ","بِضَٰعَتُنَا","رُدَّتْ","إِلَيْنَا","وَنَمِيرُ","أَهْلَنَا","وَنَحْفَظُ","أَخَانَا","وَنَزْدَادُ","كَيْلَ","بَعِيرٍ","ذَٰلِكَ","كَيْلٌ","يَسِيرٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"حَفِظَ"}},{"id":"hafiza-15-17-0","words":["verb:hafiza"],"options":[{"bs":"i čuvali smo ga","en":"and We guarded it"},{"bs":"i čuvaju","en":"and they guard"},{"bs":"čuvaju ga","en":"they guard him"},{"bs":"i čuvamo","en":"and we guard"}],"ref":"15:17","answerWord":"وَحَفِظْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/aef453a4cd591c3949bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We have guarded it from every outcast devil,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čuvati, sačuvati, naučiti napamet","en":"to guard, to keep, to memorize"},"passage":["وَحَفِظْنَٰهَا","مِن","كُلِّ","شَيْطَٰنٍ","رَّجِيمٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَفِظَ"}},{"id":"hafiza-24-30-5","words":["verb:hafiza"],"options":[{"bs":"i čuvaju","en":"and they guard"},{"bs":"i čuvamo","en":"and we guard"},{"bs":"sačuvao je","en":"he/it guarded"},{"bs":"i čuvajte!","en":"and (you all) guard!"}],"ref":"24:30","answerWord":"وَيَحْفَظُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/1e01ed552bfe06fa2b5f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Tell the believing men to lower their gaze and be modest. That is purer for them. Lo! Allah is aware of what they do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čuvati, sačuvati, naučiti napamet","en":"to guard, to keep, to memorize"},"passage":["قُل","لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","يَغُضُّوا۟","مِنْ","أَبْصَٰرِهِمْ","وَيَحْفَظُوا۟","فُرُوجَهُمْ","ذَٰلِكَ","أَزْكَىٰ","لَهُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","يَصْنَعُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"حَفِظَ"}},{"id":"itazala-2-222-6","words":["verb:itazala"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se povucite!","en":"so (you all) withdraw!"},{"bs":"onda se klonite mene","en":"then keep away from me (all of you)"},{"bs":"i povlačim se od vas","en":"and I withdraw from you (all)"},{"bs":"povukli su se od vas","en":"they withdrew from you (all)"}],"ref":"2:222","answerWord":"فَٱعْتَزِلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/f46bcd021736d4d77f5b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They question thee (O Muhammad) concerning menstruation. Say: It is an illness, so let women alone at such times and go not in unto them till they are cleansed. And when they have purified themselves, then go in unto them as Allah hath enjoined upon you. Truly Allah loveth those who turn unto Him, and loveth those who have a care for cleanness.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povući se, kloniti se","en":"to withdraw, to keep away from"},"passage":["وَيَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","عَنِ","ٱلْمَحِيضِ","قُلْ","هُوَ","أَذًى","فَٱعْتَزِلُوا۟","ٱلنِّسَآءَ","فِى","ٱلْمَحِيضِ","وَلَا","تَقْرَبُوهُنَّ","حَتَّىٰ","يَطْهُرْنَ","فَإِذَا","تَطَهَّرْنَ","فَأْتُوهُنَّ","مِنْ","حَيْثُ","أَمَرَكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلتَّوَّٰبِينَ","وَيُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُتَطَهِّرِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"اعْتَزَلَ"}},{"id":"itazala-18-16-1","words":["verb:itazala"],"options":[{"bs":"povukli ste se od njih","en":"you (all) withdrew from them"},{"bs":"pa se povucite!","en":"so (you all) withdraw!"},{"bs":"onda se klonite mene","en":"then keep away from me (all of you)"},{"bs":"povukao se od njih","en":"he/it withdrew from them"}],"ref":"18:16","answerWord":"ٱعْتَزَلْتُمُوهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/002f776a6e6982a51cde.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when ye withdraw from them and that which they worship except Allah, then seek refuge in the Cave; your Lord will spread for you of His mercy and will prepare for you a pillow in your plight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povući se, kloniti se","en":"to withdraw, to keep away from"},"passage":["وَإِذِ","ٱعْتَزَلْتُمُوهُمْ","وَمَا","يَعْبُدُونَ","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهَ","فَأْوُۥٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱلْكَهْفِ","يَنشُرْ","لَكُمْ","رَبُّكُم","مِّن","رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","وَيُهَيِّئْ","لَكُم","مِّنْ","أَمْرِكُم","مِّرْفَقًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اعْتَزَلَ"}},{"id":"itazala-19-48-0","words":["verb:itazala"],"options":[{"bs":"i povlačim se od vas","en":"and I withdraw from you (all)"},{"bs":"onda se klonite mene","en":"then keep away from me (all of you)"},{"bs":"pa se povucite!","en":"so (you all) withdraw!"},{"bs":"povukao se od njih","en":"he/it withdrew from them"}],"ref":"19:48","answerWord":"وَأَعْتَزِلُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/051d6c3e23ee9a135b39.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"I shall withdraw from you and that unto which ye pray beside Allah, and I shall pray unto my Lord. It may be that, in prayer unto my Lord, I shall not be unblest.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povući se, kloniti se","en":"to withdraw, to keep away from"},"passage":["وَأَعْتَزِلُكُمْ","وَمَا","تَدْعُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَأَدْعُوا۟","رَبِّى","عَسَىٰٓ","أَلَّآ","أَكُونَ","بِدُعَآءِ","رَبِّى","شَقِيًّا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"اعْتَزَلَ"}},{"id":"itazala-19-49-1","words":["verb:itazala"],"options":[{"bs":"povukao se od njih","en":"he/it withdrew from them"},{"bs":"povlače se od vas","en":"they withdraw from you (all)"},{"bs":"pa se povucite!","en":"so (you all) withdraw!"},{"bs":"i povlačim se od vas","en":"and I withdraw from you (all)"}],"ref":"19:49","answerWord":"ٱعْتَزَلَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/a3a1d59ddb3415e02d6b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So, when he had withdrawn from them and that which they were worshipping beside Allah, We gave him Isaac and Jacob. Each of them We made a prophet.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povući se, kloniti se","en":"to withdraw, to keep away from"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","ٱعْتَزَلَهُمْ","وَمَا","يَعْبُدُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَهَبْنَا","لَهُۥٓ","إِسْحَٰقَ","وَيَعْقُوبَ","وَكُلًّا","جَعَلْنَا","نَبِيًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"اعْتَزَلَ"}},{"id":"itazala-44-21-4","words":["verb:itazala"],"options":[{"bs":"onda se klonite mene","en":"then keep away from me (all of you)"},{"bs":"pa se povucite!","en":"so (you all) withdraw!"},{"bs":"povlače se od vas","en":"they withdraw from you (all)"},{"bs":"povukao se od njih","en":"he/it withdrew from them"}],"ref":"44:21","answerWord":"فَٱعْتَزِلُونِ","answerSound":"audio/f1cae494326bc68801ef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if ye put no faith in me, then let me go.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"povući se, kloniti se","en":"to withdraw, to keep away from"},"passage":["وَإِن","لَّمْ","تُؤْمِنُوا۟","لِى","فَٱعْتَزِلُونِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"اعْتَزَلَ"}}]